{"url": "https://wiki.idlecorp.xyz/api.php?format=json&formatversion=2&action=parse&page=Cell+phone&prop=text%7Clinks%7Cimages%7Ctemplates%7Ccategories&redirects=1", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-09T14:55:19.267457+00:00", "body": "{\"parse\":{\"title\":\"Cell phone\",\"pageid\":90,\"redirects\":[],\"text\":\"<div class=\\\"mw-parser-output\\\"><p>A cell phone is an asset manufactured in the <a href=\\\"/index.php/Cell_phone_factory\\\" title=\\\"Cell phone factory\\\"> Cell phone factories</a> and is a product that can be sold for capital.\\nA mobile phone, cellular phone, or cell phone is a portable telephone that can make and receive calls over a radio frequency link while the user is moving within a telephone service area.\\n</p>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Cell_phone_Production\\\">Cell phone Production</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Cell_phone&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Cell phone Production\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<table class=\\\"wikitable sortable\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n<th>Name</th>\\n<th>Cost</th>\\n<th>Inputs</th>\\n<th>Outputs</th>\\n<th>Profit/Min</th>\\n<th>Production <br />interval (MM:SS)\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><a href=\\\"/index.php/Cell_phone_factory\\\" title=\\\"Cell phone factory\\\">Cell phone factory</a></td>\\n<td>$400,000</td>\\n<td>1x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Glass\\\" title=\\\"Glass\\\">glass</a>, 5x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Plastic\\\" title=\\\"Plastic\\\">plastic</a>, 1x <a href=\\\"/index.php/CPU\\\" title=\\\"CPU\\\">CPU</a></td>\\n<td>1x <a class=\\\"mw-selflink selflink\\\">cell phone</a></td>\\n<td>$756.67~</td>\\n<td>0:45\\n</td></tr>\\n</tbody></table>\\n<!-- \\nNewPP limit report\\nCached time: 20261008224607\\nCache expiry: 86400\\nDynamic content: false\\nComplications: []\\nCPU time usage: 0.000 seconds\\nReal time usage: 0.003 seconds\\nPrepro